Subject: [PATCH 1/4] The Table, part two: questions by age, three short
 nights, the library by theme, and cards with a code (U21)

Every weekly devotion now asks three questions for younger children and three for older; a family picks Together, Younger, or Older and this device keeps it. A weekly devotion offers three short nights, some weeks end with a line for the grown-ups, /family gains a weekly reminder and 'If your table looks different', the library sets the Foundations out by theme, and the table cards print both bands with a QR code to each card's page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JuCQ8kZ25i9zRwNgk6bh4e
